# R&C Roofing — Visual Design System

> **Canonical reference:** `src/pages/index.astro` is the finished reference page. When in doubt, match it exactly.
> This rule is **project-specific** and must not be applied to any other project.

---

## Required Import

Every page that uses black sections or the CTA banner must import:

```astro
import simplePattern from '~/assets/images/patterns/simple.svg';
```

---

## Section Color Flow

Sections repeat in this order down every page. Never skip or reverse the order.

```
White → Grey (#FAFAFA) → Black → White → Grey → Black → … → Yellow (Final CTA)
```

---

## 1 · Hero Section (always White bg)

- Component: `Hero2` (left content / right image split)
- Background: white (default — no bg div needed)
- Motif: `simple.svg` accent yellow at **6% opacity**, top-to-bottom fade
- Left side: H1, subtitle paragraphs, primary CTA button
- Right side: hero image
- No eyebrow text. No gold bar. No `isDark`.
- **Do NOT add `tag-pill` badges unless they are explicitly listed in the content brief.** Omit `<Fragment slot="content">` entirely when badges are not provided.

```astro
<Hero2
  actions={[{ variant: 'primary', text: 'CTA Text', href: '/contact' }]}
  image={{ src: 'IMAGE_URL', alt: 'Alt text' }}
>
  <Fragment slot="title">Page H1<br />Line Two</Fragment>
  <Fragment slot="subtitle">
    First paragraph.
    <br /><br />
    Second paragraph.
  </Fragment>
  <!-- Only include the content slot when badges are explicitly given in the content brief -->
  <!-- <Fragment slot="content">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 mt-6">
      <span class="tag-pill">Badge One</span>
    </div>
  </Fragment> -->
  <Fragment slot="bg">
    <div class="absolute inset-0" style="-webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, black 0%, transparent 100%); mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, black 0%, transparent 100%);">
      <div
        class="absolute inset-0 opacity-[6%]"
        style={`background-color: var(--aw-color-accent); -webkit-mask-image: url('${simplePattern.src}'); mask-image: url('${simplePattern.src}'); -webkit-mask-size: cover; mask-size: cover; -webkit-mask-mode: luminance; mask-mode: luminance;`}
        aria-hidden="true"
      ></div>
    </div>
  </Fragment>
</Hero2>
```

