## 4 · White Section Rules (`bg-white`)

- Background: white (no bg div needed, or explicit `bg-white`)
- Headings: `text-heading`
- Body text: `text-muted`
- No motif

### Card on White bg
```astro
<div class="rounded-lg border border-accent/50 bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 p-4 md:p-5 flex flex-col">
  <h3 class="text-[18px] md:text-[20px] font-medium font-heading leading-[130%] mb-1 text-heading">{title}</h3>
  <p class="text-[13px] md:text-[14px] font-medium leading-[160%] text-muted">{description}</p>
</div>
```

### Ghost button on White bg

```astro
<a href="/path" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3 rounded-md border-2 border-black text-black font-semibold text-[15px] leading-snug hover:bg-black hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200">
  Button Label
</a>
```

- Border: `border-2 border-black`
- Text: `text-black`
- Hover: `hover:bg-black hover:text-white`

