## 5 · Final CTA Banner (always last section on every page)

- The `WidgetWrapper` section always sits on a **white background** (no bg override needed on the wrapper itself)
- The inner card: `bg-accent` (yellow) — **no border on the card**
- Motif: `simple.svg` **black** at **3% opacity**, top-to-bottom fade
- Heading: `text-black`
- Body text: `text-black/70`
- Contact info: `text-black/70`, name bold `text-black`
- Separator: `border-t-2 border-black`
- CTA button: `bg-black text-white hover:bg-zinc-900`

```astro
<WidgetWrapper containerClass="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto">
  <div class="relative w-full p-8 md:p-12 rounded-md overflow-hidden bg-accent">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 rounded-md overflow-hidden" style="-webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, black 0%, transparent 100%); mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, black 0%, transparent 100%);">
      <div
        class="absolute inset-0 opacity-[3%]"
        style={`background-color: #000; -webkit-mask-image: url('${simplePattern.src}'); mask-image: url('${simplePattern.src}'); -webkit-mask-size: cover; mask-size: cover; -webkit-mask-mode: luminance; mask-mode: luminance;`}
        aria-hidden="true"
      ></div>
    </div>
    <div class="relative z-10">
      <div class="text-center mb-8 md:mb-10">
        <h2 class="text-[30px] md:text-[40px] font-normal leading-[120%] tracking-tighter font-heading text-black mb-4">CTA Heading</h2>
        <p class="text-[16px] md:text-[17px] font-medium leading-[160%] text-black/70">Supporting sentence.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between gap-6 border-t-2 border-black pt-8">
        <div class="text-[15px] md:text-[16px] font-medium leading-[180%] text-black/70">
          <p class="font-semibold text-black text-[16px] md:text-[17px]">R&amp;C Roofing Contractors</p>
          <p>3302 Campbell Ave, Honolulu, HI 96815</p>
          <p>(808) 888-2524</p>
        </div>
        <a href="/contact" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3 rounded-md bg-black text-white font-semibold text-[15px] leading-snug hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors duration-200 shrink-0">Schedule a Roof Inspection</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</WidgetWrapper>
```

